🏏 IPL Data Analysis Dashboard (2008–2025)
   ---------------------------------------
This project is based on real IPL data (2008–2025) containing over 278,000 records.
The goal was to analyze player and team performances across all seasons using Power BI and create an interactive dashboard that showcases year-wise and player-wise insights.

🧠 Key Highlights
  ----------------
      Used Power BI to create all required data tables and relationships directly from the raw dataset.
      Built multiple visual reports to track:
      ->Player-wise and year-wise performance
      ->Team comparisons and trends
      ->Match outcomes, toss results, and venues

Developed a fully interactive dashboard with slicers, filters, and dynamic visuals for detailed exploration.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies
  ----------------------
     ->Power BI – Data modeling, DAX, and dashboard creation
     ->Microsoft Excel / CSV – Source data file (clean and real IPL data)

📊 Dashboard Features
  --------------------
  📅 Year-wise and player-wise analysis
     ->Team performance metrics and trends
     ->Custom filters, and dynamic charts
     ->Insights on top players, runs, wickets, and match stats

  📂 Dataset Information
     ->Type: Real IPL dataset (2008–2025)
     ->Records: 278,000+ rows
     ->Includes: Match details, player stats, teams, venues, and results
